  "raw_response": "```haskell\nnqueens :: Int -> [[(Int, Int)]]\nnqueens n = filter isValid $ permutations [1..n]\n  where\n    isValid xs = all ok $ zip [1..] xs\n    ok (i, j) = i /= j && abs(i-j) /= abs(head xs - tail xs)\n      where xs = reverse $ take 2 $ dropWhile ((/=j).snd) $ zip [1..] xs\n\u00a0\nmain = do\n  print $ length $ nqueens 8\n```"
